-top:0.5rem\"><time dateTime=\"2025-06-09\" style=\"font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-muted)\">Jun 9, 2025</time><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600\">Read Guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Read: How to Crop Images for Every Social Media Platform\" href=\"/blog/how-to-crop-images-for-social-media\"><div><span class=\"badge\" style=\"background-color:#6366f120;color:#6366f1;font-size:0.65rem;font-weight:600\">Image Tools</span></div><h3 style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin:0;line-height:1.4;color:var(--text-primary)\">How to Crop Images for Every Social Media Platform</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.5\">Complete 2025 guide to social media image dimensions. Crop images to the right aspect ratio for Instagram, YouTube, TikTok, LinkedIn, and more.</p><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:0.5rem\"><time dateTime=\"2025-06-11\" style=\"font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--text-muted)\">Jun 11, 2025</time><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600\">Read Guide →</span></div></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Read: Complete Image Optimization Guide for Faster Page Speed\" href=\"/blog/image-optimization-for-page-speed\"><div><span class=\"badge\" style=\"background-color:#6366f120;color:#6366f1;font-size:0.65rem;font-weight:600\">Image Tools</span></div><h3 style=\"font-size:1.05rem;margin:0;line-height:1.4;color:var(--text-primary)\">Complete Image Optimization Guide for Faster Page Speed</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.5\">A technical guide to image optimization for page speed. Covers format selection, compression, lazy loading, responsive images, and CDN delivery.</p><div styl